OL,3,GNEWSARidiculed MSP says chest infection
OL,4,Aand lack of sleep led to committee
OL,5,Ablunder
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn MSP who faced ridicule over a
OL,8,Fblunder at a Holyrood committee has
OL,9,Fsaid she suffered a "momentary lapse"
OL,10,Fbrought on by lack of sleep and a chest
OL,11,Finfection.
OL,13,FCollette Stevenson, who has represented
OL,14,FEast Kilbride since 2021 and is a
OL,15,Fmember of the transport committee, was
OL,16,Fcriticised after asking if Transport
OL,17,FScotland was a registered charity.
OL,19,FTransport Scotland director Graeme Cook
OL,20,Fthen explained to her that it was a
OL,21,Fnational agency which was part of the
OL,22,FScottish government.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
